dsh-proxy-port README · C. By hand, through profile files：A profile plugin is a bundle: the plugin page lists bundles, so a bare loader row never appears there. From a checkout at `/path/to/dsh-proxy-port`, edit `~/.dsh/profiles/<profile>/package.json` (on the desktop build the profile is `desktop`):

```jsonc
{
  "dependencies": { "dsh-proxy-port": "file:/path/to/dsh-proxy-port" },
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": ["…", "dsh-proxy-port"] } }
}
